<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Telefonica started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Telefonica started as buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale Securities analyst Jos Linares started coverage of Telefnica del Per Thursday with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- In a report, he set a 12-month price target of $32 per American Depositary Receipt (ADR).</p>
<p>-- He estimated 1997 and 1998 earnings per ADR at $1.85 and $2.20, respectively.</p>
<p>-- The company's ADRs were unchanged at 26.</p>
<p>-- In Lima, the shares were up 11 cntimos to 6.90 soles.</p>
<p>((-- Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, 212 859-1879))</p>
